The deposited coordinate files and structure-factor data under targets/<ID>/deposited/ and
targets/<ID>/data/ derive from the Protein Data Bank (wwPDB), whose data are released under CC0 1.0
(https://www.wwpdb.org/about/usage-policies). Cite the original entry and its primary citation
(targets/<ID>/deposited/rcsb_entry.json) when you use them.

